1
00:00:01,217 --> 00:00:02,787
Catarina Claes,

2
00:00:02,917 --> 00:00:08,287
we are going to expose all of the evil 
deeds you have committed, here and now!

3
00:00:09,077 --> 00:00:11,477
<i>Evil deeds? Me?</i>

4
00:00:12,857 --> 00:00:14,717
Wait, like what?

5
00:00:15,057 --> 00:00:17,257
<i>Do they mean when I throw toy snakes?</i>

6
00:00:17,257 --> 00:00:20,017
<i>Or did they find out I started 
a farm on school grounds?</i>

7
00:00:20,017 --> 00:00:22,427
<i>If not, there's... uh...</i>

8
00:00:23,217 --> 00:00:25,507
You have flaunted your position

9
00:00:25,507 --> 00:00:28,777
as a duke's daughter and Geordo-sama's fiancée

10
00:00:28,777 --> 00:00:31,007
to tyrannize those of lower status than yourself!

11
00:00:31,007 --> 00:00:34,517
And your jealousy toward the light magic 
user Maria Campbell because of her closeness

12
00:00:34,517 --> 00:00:36,197
to Geordo-sama and his friends

13
00:00:36,197 --> 00:00:38,817
has led you to bully her in ways 
that border on criminal!

14
00:00:38,987 --> 00:00:43,337
<i>What? This all sounds familiar...</i>

15
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:45,237
<i>I remember now!</i>

16
00:00:45,237 --> 00:00:47,237
<i>I saw it over and over in the game!</i>

17
00:00:47,237 --> 00:00:49,817
<i>It's Catarina Claes's judgment event!</i>

18
00:00:53,687 --> 00:00:56,787
<i>After having her crimes exposed 
in front of everyone, just like this,</i>

19
00:00:56,787 --> 00:01:00,997
<i>Catarina is led toward her doom ending!</i>

20
00:01:01,257 --> 00:01:04,417
<i>I can't believe it's happening now!</i>

21
00:01:04,787 --> 00:01:07,767
<i>But wait... the ones who judged Catarina</i>

22
00:01:07,767 --> 00:01:09,877
<i>were the conquerable characters.</i>

23
00:01:10,147 --> 00:01:12,227
<i>In Geordo's route, Geordo did it,</i>

24
00:01:12,227 --> 00:01:14,127
<i>and in Keith's route, Keith did it.</i>

25
00:01:14,127 --> 00:01:17,337
<i>They took a stand to 
protect Maria, I thought...</i>

26
00:01:18,097 --> 00:01:20,117
Wait, what?

27
00:01:20,117 --> 00:01:21,627
Don't bother playing dumb!

28
00:01:21,627 --> 00:01:24,157
We have concrete proof right here!

29
00:01:24,767 --> 00:01:26,767
This is a record of all the harassment

30
00:01:26,767 --> 00:01:31,897
Catarina Claes has subjected Maria Campbell 
to, complete with evidence.

31
00:01:31,897 --> 00:01:35,787
I saw you bullying her 
with my own eyes lots of times!

32
00:01:43,347 --> 00:01:44,957
What is this all about?

33
00:01:46,587 --> 00:01:47,967
Geordo-sama!

34
00:01:48,257 --> 00:01:49,967
Just look at this!

35
00:01:59,417 --> 00:02:03,867
<i>This is exactly what happened 
in Catarina's judgment event in the game!</i>

36
00:02:03,867 --> 00:02:07,727
