1420
00:15:01,827 --> 00:15:03,837
<i>No matter which route you follow,</i>

1421
00:15:03,837 --> 00:15:05,957
<i>there's no way a future like that can exist.</i>

1422
00:15:06,677 --> 00:15:12,377
<i>And I've made so many preparations 
to help me overcome this kind of danger.</i>

1423
00:15:13,107 --> 00:15:15,547
<i>It's fine. It's going to be fine.</i>

1424
00:15:20,457 --> 00:15:23,197
Sister? You look pale.

1425
00:15:23,197 --> 00:15:25,657
Good morning, Catarina-sama.

1426
00:15:25,827 --> 00:15:27,817
Morning...

1427
00:15:29,377 --> 00:15:30,497
Sister?!

1428
00:15:38,557 --> 00:15:40,727
I slept so well.

1429
00:15:40,727 --> 00:15:44,317
<i>I didn't get much sleep 
last night after that dream.</i>

1430
00:15:45,827 --> 00:15:48,437
I feel much better now, Sensei.

1431
00:15:48,437 --> 00:15:49,727
Thank you very much.

1432
00:15:49,827 --> 00:15:51,587
That's good to hear.

1433
00:15:51,587 --> 00:15:53,567
Are you going to head back to class?

1434
00:15:53,567 --> 00:15:54,307
Yes.

1435
00:15:57,517 --> 00:16:02,387
<i>Geordo told me to make sure 
I didn't do anything alone,</i>

1436
00:16:02,387 --> 00:16:06,337
<i>but no one's around, 
and it's not that far. I'll be fine!</i>

1437
00:16:13,947 --> 00:16:16,937
<i>This is where Maria 
and I first became friends.</i>

1438
00:16:19,667 --> 00:16:20,797
<i>Maria...</i>

1439
00:16:22,667 --> 00:16:25,177
<i>I wonder where she is right now.</i>

1440
00:16:25,727 --> 00:16:27,957
<i>I hope she's not scared...</i>

1441
00:16:28,357 --> 00:16:30,217
<i>I hope she's not hungry...</i>

1442
00:16:33,717 --> 00:16:35,647
Oh? Catarina-san?

1443
00:16:38,017 --> 00:16:39,847
What are you doing out here?

1444
00:16:41,107 --> 00:16:42,447
President...

1445
00:16:42,887 --> 00:16:47,937
Um, I didn't feel well, 
so I was resting in the doctor's office.

1446
00:16:47,937 --> 00:16:50,077
I'll be heading back 
to my classroom from here.

1447
00:16:50,077 --> 00:16:50,987
I see.

1448
00:16:51,297 --> 00:16:53,817
But Maria-san still hasn't been found,

1449
00:16:53,817 --> 00:16:55,527
and it's dangerous for you to be alone.

1450
00:16:55,527 --> 00:16:56,827
Let me walk you back.

1451
00:16:57,537 --> 00:16:59,137
Thank you.

1452
00:17:01,467 --> 00:17:05,817
<i>Wait... what is he doing out here?</i>

1453
00:17:05,817 --> 00:17:08,007
<i>Classes are in session right now...</i>

1454
00:17:11,017 --> 00:17:15,777
<i>His bright red hair and 
glittering gray eyes are so pretty.</i>

1455
00:17:17,757 --> 00:17:20,817
<i>There's one route that's really tough!</i>

1456
00:17:20,817 --> 00:17:23,007
There's a hidden character you can conquer,

1457
00:17:23,007 --> 00:17:26,267
but he's a dangerous guy who has dark magic!

1458
00:17:26,267 --> 00:17:27,527
Huh?!

1459
00:17:27,527 --> 00:17:32,377
If you fail to conquer him, 
he kills the protagonist and all of her friends!

1460
00:17:32,377 --> 00:17:34,237
It's a <i>super</i> bad ending!

1461
00:17:34,237 --> 00:17:35,287
That bad?!

1462
00:17:35,287 --> 00:17:40,437
By the way, this hidden character 
has bright red hair and gray eyes—

1463
00:17:40,437 --> 00:17:42,647
Wait! Don't say any more!

1464
00:17:42,647 --> 00:17:44,317
No spoilers!

1465
00:17:45,067 --> 00:17:46,097
<i>That's it!</i>

1466
00:17:46,097 --> 00:17:49,587
<i>Acchan told me about the game's hidden character</i>

1467
00:17:49,587 --> 00:17:52,177
<i>and the ending that came with him!</i>

1468
00:17:55,507 --> 00:17:59,447
<i>How could I forget something 
so important for so long?!</i>

1469
00:17:59,447 --> 00:18:01,547
<i>I really am an idiot!</i>

1470
00:18:02,137 --> 00:18:05,157
<i>The student council president, Sirius Dieke...</i>

1471
00:18:05,697 --> 00:18:08,777
<i>He's the hidden character from the game!</i>

1472
00:18:09,567 --> 00:18:15,537
<i>I can hardly believe that he would 
kill all the people I care about.</i>

1473
00:18:15,877 --> 00:18:18,257
<i>But if my memory from my past life is right,</i>

1474
00:18:18,257 --> 00:18:20,287
<i>he has definitely dark magic.</i>

1475
00:18:20,947 --> 00:18:24,407
<i>The terrifying power gained 
in exchange for a human life...</i>

1476
00:18:25,097 --> 00:18:27,297
Catarina-san? What's the matter?

1477
00:18:29,147 --> 00:18:32,527
<i>Is he... Is he really the one?</i>

1478
00:18:34,847 --> 00:18:39,457
Do you... have dark magic, President?

1479
00:18:39,457 --> 00:18:41,937
Did you use it to do something to Maria?

1480
00:18:43,307 --> 00:18:45,067
Dark magic?

1481
00:18:45,817 --> 00:18:48,477
<i>Oops! It slipped right out!</i>

1482
00:18:50,127 --> 00:18:51,757
What's that?

1483
00:18:53,787 --> 00:18:57,467
<i>Of course... You don't know what that is, right?</i>

1484
00:18:57,467 --> 00:19:00,717
<i>I didn't know, either, until Geordo told me.</i>

1485
00:19:00,717 --> 00:19:03,657
<i>Maybe this reality is different 
from the game's setting.</i>

1486
00:19:03,657 --> 00:19:07,647
<i>My friends are different from 
the game characters in lots of ways, too.</i>

1487
00:19:07,647 --> 00:19:10,337
<i>There's a good chance 
the same goes for the president.</i>

1488
00:19:10,337 --> 00:19:14,087
There's no way a kind person like 
you could be behind it, is there?

1489
00:19:17,857 --> 00:19:18,967
President?

1490
00:19:19,347 --> 00:19:20,967
Kind, eh?

1491
00:19:21,367 --> 00:19:24,047
You say that about me quite often.

1492
00:19:24,347 --> 00:19:26,687
W-Well, you really are...

1493
00:19:26,687 --> 00:19:28,797
That's just an act.

1494
00:19:28,797 --> 00:19:32,327
It's easier to get by if I 
pretend to be a nice, quiet boy.

1495
00:19:32,857 --> 00:19:36,357
It looks like all of you 
idiots fell for it, though.

1496
00:19:38,327 --> 00:19:41,187
I'm the one who took Maria Campbell, too.

1497
00:19:41,187 --> 00:19:44,237
She learned something 
she didn't need to know.

1498
00:19:46,077 --> 00:19:48,497
President, what is that?

1499
00:19:51,467 --> 00:19:54,257
Maria-san? What's the matter?

1500
00:19:54,357 --> 00:19:59,347
You're surrounded by the same black fog that I saw

1501
00:19:59,497 --> 00:20:02,137
when those girls besmirched Catarina-sama!

1502
00:20:03,027 --> 00:20:04,517
<i>She saw it?!</i>

1503
00:20:13,847 --> 00:20:16,377
I should've expected that from one who has light magic.

1504
00:20:16,807 --> 00:20:17,607
You're right.

1505
00:20:17,907 --> 00:20:20,027
I'm the one behind what happened.

1506
00:20:20,457 --> 00:20:22,707
All to get rid of that detestable girl.

1507
00:20:23,777 --> 00:20:27,847
But that's something you don't need to know about...

1508
00:20:30,087 --> 00:20:32,697
so you're going to forget everything.

1509
00:20:34,137 --> 00:20:35,587
Let go of me!

1510
00:20:36,977 --> 00:20:38,687
<i>The dark magic isn't affecting her?!</i>

1511
00:20:38,877 --> 00:20:42,567
If you hurt Catarina-sama, I'll make you regret it!

1512
00:20:42,567 --> 00:20:45,017
Why would you want to—

1513
00:21:01,607 --> 00:21:04,917
Catarina Claes, I absolutely hate you!

1514
00:21:04,917 --> 00:21:08,797
You reached out to those lonely guys thinking 
you were saving them, but you're a hypocrite!

1515
00:21:08,797 --> 00:21:11,467
Watching you irritates me to no end!

1516
00:21:11,467 --> 00:21:13,927
Just go off somewhere and disappear already!

1517
00:21:14,867 --> 00:21:17,937
<i>I don't understand what he's saying...</i>

1518
00:21:17,937 --> 00:21:22,007
<i>So, um... he really, really hates me,</i>

1519
00:21:22,007 --> 00:21:23,927
<i>he's the one who took Maria away,</i>

1520
00:21:24,167 --> 00:21:29,657
<i>and he's the one who might kill 
all the people I care about soon...</i>

1521
00:21:30,277 --> 00:21:31,277
<i>And yet...</i>

1522
00:21:35,367 --> 00:21:36,677
Are you all right?

1523
00:21:38,187 --> 00:21:39,147
<i>He feels cold...</i>

1524
00:21:40,027 --> 00:21:44,687
<i>He looks like he's in such pain... 
such agony... that he could cry.</i>

1525
00:21:46,247 --> 00:21:49,087
Enough! Just leave me alone!

1526
00:21:49,357 --> 00:21:52,327
Get out of my sight right now!

1527
00:21:55,527 --> 00:21:59,537
Huh? Everything's... dark...

1528
00:22:01,237 --> 00:22:04,197
You can just stay asleep...

1529
00:22:04,197 --> 00:22:07,227
until your life runs out.

